{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u25c6This board game is a mahjong game played by 4 people or computer.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2119440/extras/steam_001.png?t=1738922814\" />You can play with 3 ai users by yourself, Or you can play Mahjong with 3 other real users.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u25c6This game supports traditional [Chinese mahjong] and [Japanese riich mahjong].</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2119440/extras/steam_002.png?t=1738922814\" />Tutorials, practice( single play mode ), and online play ( 4 user play mode ) supported.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">We provide two styles of mahjong tiles for western players unfamiliar with mahjong games.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u25c6You can learn how to play Mahjong by investing only 10 minutes in the tutorial.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2119440/extras/steam_003.png?t=1738922814\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">This game requires a network connection for online play. If the network connection is not smooth, the game will not play normally.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The game also supports single play game with AI players.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u25c6Mahjong is a game that requires skill.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Our games are played by thousands of real users every day.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">More than 30% of users have played this game more than 10,000 times.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You'll have to play that much and you'll be of average skill.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">If you are in doubt about the game opponent, please report it using the replay function.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u25c6This game has in-app purchase items.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You can purchase 3, 5, 9, 30, or 50 gold items.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2119440/extras/steam_gold.png?t=1738922814\" />Purchased gold can be used to exchange for game money, avatars, and other items.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Many Mahjong players await your challenge.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2119440?t=1738922814","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2119440/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1738922814","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2119440/cbb9131ab70728d7ff9658a2c608070176b98746/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1738922814","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2119440/cbb9131ab70728d7ff9658a2c608070176b98746/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1738922814","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"PvP","id":49},{"description":"Online PvP","id":36},{"description":"In-App Purchases","id":35}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u25c6This board game is a mahjong game played by 4 people or computer.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2119440/extras/steam_001.png?t=1738922814\" />You can play with 3 ai users by yourself, Or you can play Mahjong with 3 other real users.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u25c6This game supports traditional [Chinese mahjong] and [Japanese riich mahjong].</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2119440/extras/steam_002.png?t=1738922814\" />Tutorials, practice( single play mode ), and online play ( 4 user play mode ) supported.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">We provide two styles of mahjong tiles for western players unfamiliar with mahjong games.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u25c6You can learn how to play Mahjong by investing only 10 minutes in the tutorial.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2119440/extras/steam_003.png?t=1738922814\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">This game requires a network connection for online play. If the network connection is not smooth, the game will not play normally.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The game also supports single play game with AI players.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u25c6Mahjong is a game that requires skill.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Our games are played by thousands of real users every day.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">More than 30% of users have played this game more than 10,000 times.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You'll have to play that much and you'll be of average skill.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">If you are in doubt about the game opponent, please report it using the replay function.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u25c6This game has in-app purchase items.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You can purchase 3, 5, 9, 30, or 50 gold items.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2119440/extras/steam_gold.png?t=1738922814\" />Purchased gold can be used to exchange for game money, avatars, and other items.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Many Mahjong players await your challenge.</p>","developers":["MasterGames Co;Ltd;"],"genres":[{"description":"Simulation","id":"28"},{"description":"Strategy","id":"2"},{"description":"Free To Play","id":"37"}],"header_image":"https://